Rule 9 (input_size and hidden_size must be of the same parity)
{input_size : int, hidden_size : int} |= input_size % 2 = hidden_size % 2
>>
Rule 10 (input tensor should be of appropriate size according to input_size)
{input : tensor, input_size : int} |= shape(input, 0) = input_size
>>
