Rule 22 (Check dimensions in input tensor)
{input: tensor} |= ndim(input) > 0
>>
Rule 23 (Check dimensions in hidden tensor)
{hidden: tensor} |= ndim(hidden) > 0
>>
Rule 24 (Check if input tensor shape is same as hidden tensor shape)
{input: tensor, hidden: tensor} |= shape(input) = shape(hidden)
>>
Rule 25 (primitive type variable should not be zero)
{v_1 : int ⊎ float} |= v_1 ≠ 0
>>
Rule 26 (tensor dimensions greater than zero)
